          SHORT="Wallpaper tool for Wayland compositors"

cat << EOF
swaybg is a wallpaper utility for Wayland compositors. It is compatible with
any Wayland compositor which implements the following Wayland protocols:
  wlr-layer-shell
  xdg-output
  xdg-shell
EOF
